---

---

<section class="w-full max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 py-16 lg:py-24 relative z-10">
  <!-- Section Header -->
  <div class="text-center max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-14">
    <div
      class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3.5 py-1 rounded-full bg-rose-500/10 border border-rose-500/30 text-rose-400 font-mono text-xs font-semibold tracking-widest uppercase mb-4 glow-border-rose"
    >
      <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-rose-400 animate-ping"></span>
      THE PROBLEM
    </div>
    <h2
      class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-mono font-bold text-white mb-4 leading-tight"
    >
      Wazuh Alone Doesn’t Scale to a Senior Analyst
    </h2>
    <p class="text-slate-300 text-base md:text-lg leading-relaxed">
      Raw alerts need a skilled human to triage, correlate, and decide. A small
      team can't staff that around the clock.
    </p>
  </div>

  <!-- 3 Column Feature Cards -->
  <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6 lg:gap-8">
    <!-- Card 1: Alert Fatigue -->
    <div
      class="glass-panel-interactive p-6 md:p-8 border border-slate-800/80 bg-cyber-card/40 backdrop-blur-xl relative overflow-hidden group"
    >
      <div
        class="p-3.5 bg-rose-500/10 border border-rose-500/30 text-rose-400 w-fit mb-6 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform duration-300"
      >
        <svg
          xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
          class="w-6 h-6"
          viewBox="0 0 24 24"
          fill="none"
          stroke="currentColor"
          stroke-width="2"
          stroke-linecap="round"
          stroke-linejoin="round"
        >
          <line x1="18" y1="20" x2="18" y2="10"></line>
          <line x1="12" y1="20" x2="12" y2="4"></line>
          <line x1="6" y1="20" x2="6" y2="14"></line>
        </svg>
      </div>
      <h3
        class="text-xl font-mono font-bold text-white mb-3 group-hover:text-rose-400 transition-colors"
      >
        Alert Fatigue
      </h3>
      <p class="text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">
        Hundreds of raw alerts per day — almost all noise. The actual signal
        gets buried and missed by the time a human reviews it.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Card 2: Senior-Only Triage -->
    <div
      class="glass-panel-interactive p-6 md:p-8 border border-slate-800/80 bg-cyber-card/40 backdrop-blur-xl relative overflow-hidden group"
    >
      <div
        class="p-3.5 bg-amber-500/10 border border-amber-500/30 text-amber-400 w-fit mb-6 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform duration-300"
      >
        <svg
          xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
          class="w-6 h-6"
          viewBox="0 0 24 24"
          fill="none"
          stroke="currentColor"
          stroke-width="2"
          stroke-linecap="round"
          stroke-linejoin="round"
        >
          <path d="M16 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H6a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2"></path>
          <circle cx="9" cy="7" r="4"></circle>
          <polyline points="16 11 18 13 22 9"></polyline>
        </svg>
      </div>
      <h3
        class="text-xl font-mono font-bold text-white mb-3 group-hover:text-amber-400 transition-colors"
      >
        Senior-Only Triage
      </h3>
      <p class="text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">
        Every alert needs a skilled Tier-3 analyst to correlate events,
        investigate context, and make a confident decision.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Card 3: No 24/7 Coverage -->
    <div
      class="glass-panel-interactive p-6 md:p-8 border border-slate-800/80 bg-cyber-card/40 backdrop-blur-xl relative overflow-hidden group"
    >
      <div
        class="p-3.5 bg-cyan-500/10 border border-cyan-500/30 text-cyan-400 w-fit mb-6 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform duration-300"
      >
        <svg
          xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
          class="w-6 h-6"
          viewBox="0 0 24 24"
          fill="none"
          stroke="currentColor"
          stroke-width="2"
          stroke-linecap="round"
          stroke-linejoin="round"
        >
          <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle>
          <polyline points="12 6 12 12 16 14"></polyline>
        </svg>
      </div>
      <h3
        class="text-xl font-mono font-bold text-white mb-3 group-hover:text-cyan-400 transition-colors"
      >
        No 24/7 Coverage
      </h3>
      <p class="text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">
        A small team can't staff round-the-clock manual investigation, IOC
        lookups, and incident documentation.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
